WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.399
Things got real gross real fast aboard

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.279
the Manticor. In the cramped confines of

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:07.759
the Hold, our crew faced off against

00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:10.559
three slotty creatures from the plane of

00:00:10.559 --> 00:00:14.160
chaos. Lumi's spirit guardians churned a

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.240
radiant soup while Room dropped

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.640
confusion and a unicorn spirit totem,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.400
and the captain carved through the enemy

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.560
line with Eldrich blasts and riding

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.680
tentacles. Bit by bit, the tide turned.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.519
dispatching the green slot back to his

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:32.079
home plane. Then red went down, followed

00:00:32.079 --> 00:00:34.800
by the blue. But what's to become of the

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.600
ugly red marks blooming on the skins of

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.960
our captain and room? Both unable to

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.879
heal heal their wounds as their

00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:46.399
infection grows.

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:49.920
Lumi's healing magic slid off like oil.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.879
Dispel magic did nothing.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:55.039
And the victory came with the creeping

00:00:55.039 --> 00:00:57.520
awareness that something was living

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.640
inside you.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:03.199
Shaken but not broken. The crew are

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.960
greeted on deck by a strange welcome

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.119
wagon in wild space. A formation of

00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:10.000
modrons who calmly clinically confirmed

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.880
your fears. You are infected. Your

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.640
condition is progressing. And the

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.000
standard outcome is death.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.280
>> For those two.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:24.080
>> For those two. Yes, their mission to

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.920
open a portal was complete. They were

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.240
heading out and if anybody came to clean

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.799
up this contamination, our crew didn't

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:33.360
want to be around for their arrival.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.520
Also above deck, the captain finds the

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.560
faces of foes defeated aboard carved

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.119
into the mast like a running tally of

00:01:41.119 --> 00:01:43.920
sins.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.600
The astroplaning hanging in the

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.439
distance, the captain rallied the crew

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:50.159
with a rousing speech and a shot of

00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:52.240
dwarven snake bite.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:55.600
With no way to heal and no time to

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.159
spare, we find ourselves pointed toward

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.479
the rift in reality. Watching the

00:02:00.479 --> 00:02:03.119
familiar stars stretch and tear, driving

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:06.079
the manticor ever forward in bid to

00:02:06.079 --> 00:02:08.319
reach the distant flotillaa before the

00:02:08.319 --> 00:02:12.920
thing in your veins wakes up hungry.

00:02:15.599 --> 00:02:19.319
Welcome to Bquentude.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.319
I liked it better when we were just

00:02:22.319 --> 00:02:24.959
sailing the seas and crawling through

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:28.280
vicious buttholes.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.440
That was exciting times

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.480
along for the times of there being water

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:38.440
and a a horizon.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.599
>> Yeah. Um

00:02:43.599 --> 00:02:46.239
let me give you guys a little bit of

00:02:46.239 --> 00:02:50.640
labor. How's that?

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.840
>> Out here, the sky is not really a sky at

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.519
all. It's a limitless ocean of soft

00:02:57.519 --> 00:02:59.920
silver that goes on forever in every

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.920
direction.

